{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">即將迎來63歲生日的龔慈恩（龔姐）向來保養得宜、氣質出眾，是圈中公認的「凍齡女神」。日前她在社交平台分享了一輯於戶外草地上拍攝的日常靚相，大方以素顏狀態示人，並笑言自己的穿搭很有70年代復古風，隨即引來大批網民以及女兒林愷鈴留言表白。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"68d7ab2f-d71f-4fba-a6c9-0be96030ea4a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026gmixBMfDR91788316344.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"68d7ab2f-d71f-4fba-a6c9-0be96030ea4a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"269a999d-b436-4cca-a969-d553d3bf1fec.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262p4OO3PCma1788316343.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"269a999d-b436-4cca-a969-d553d3bf1fec.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見龔慈恩隨性地坐在草地上與鏡頭互動，沒有化妝的她依舊狀態爆燈，膚質平滑透亮、白皙有光澤，幾乎找不到歲月痕跡。女兒林愷鈴更第一時間化身粉絲，在留言區以英文幽默表白：「Hi! I am your fan!」（你好！我是你的粉絲！），母女倆如朋友般的親密互動可愛又溫馨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eb29c2e1-55aa-40fd-898d-8b01f472cea0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026nPH5uhl1ud1788316343.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eb29c2e1-55aa-40fd-898d-8b01f472cea0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不少網民亦紛紛留言激讚龔慈恩的保養功力：「隨便影都咁靚」、「素顏無敵」、「呢啲就真係美魔女啦！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T03:03:53.724936+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}